{"total": 136.413, "lines": [{"cap": "E se você só pudesse pedir desculpa três vezes na vida?", "start": 0.36, "end": 3.443, "audio_at": 0.3, "dur": 3.322541, "words": [{"text": "E", "start": 0.36, "end": 0.481}, {"text": "se", "start": 0.493, "end": 0.603}, {"text": "você", "start": 0.615, "end": 0.894}, {"text": "só", "start": 0.906, "end": 1.064}, {"text": "pudesse", "start": 1.076, "end": 1.525}, {"text": "pedir", "start": 1.537, "end": 1.792}, {"text": "desculpa", "start": 1.804, "end": 2.29}, {"text": "três", "start": 2.302, "end": 2.642}, {"text": "vezes", "start": 2.654, "end": 2.981}, {"text": "na", "start": 2.994, "end": 3.115}, {"text": "vida", "start": 3.127, "end": 3.443}]}, {"cap": "Aqui, todo mundo nasce com um número no pulso: três. Cada \"desculpa\" gasta um.", "start": 4.133, "end": 9.762, "audio_at": 4.073, "dur": 5.8695829999999996, "words": [{"text": "Aqui", "start": 4.133, "end": 4.582}, {"text": "todo", "start": 4.751, "end": 5.031}, {"text": "mundo", "start": 5.043, "end": 5.358}, {"text": "nasce", "start": 5.37, "end": 5.747}, {"text": "com", "start": 5.759, "end": 5.917}, {"text": "um", "start": 5.929, "end": 5.989}, {"text": "número", "start": 6.001, "end": 6.293}, {"text": "no", "start": 6.305, "end": 6.414}, {"text": "pulso", "start": 6.426, "end": 6.802}, {"text": "três", "start": 6.985, "end": 7.409}, {"text": "Cada", "start": 8.245, "end": 8.524}, {"text": "desculpa", "start": 8.621, "end": 9.095}, {"text": "gasta", "start": 9.107, "end": 9.507}, {"text": "um", "start": 9.519, "end": 9.762}]}, {"cap": "Com seis anos, eu quebrei o vaso da sala. Pedi desculpa. Dois.", "start": 10.452, "end": 16.142, "audio_at": 10.392, "dur": 5.930292, "words": [{"text": "Com", "start": 10.452, "end": 10.658}, {"text": "seis", "start": 10.671, "end": 10.877}, {"text": "anos", "start": 10.889, "end": 11.277}, {"text": "eu", "start": 11.593, "end": 11.69}, {"text": "quebrei", "start": 11.702, "end": 12.054}, {"text": "o", "start": 12.066, "end": 12.139}, {"text": "vaso", "start": 12.151, "end": 12.479}, {"text": "da", "start": 12.491, "end": 12.6}, {"text": "sala", "start": 12.612, "end": 13.001}, {"text": "Pedi", "start": 13.837, "end": 14.14}, {"text": "desculpa", "start": 14.152, "end": 14.747}, {"text": "Dois", "start": 15.584, "end": 16.142}]}, {"cap": "Minha mãe olhou pro meu pulso e disse: \"Guarda isso, filho. Desculpa é coisa séria.\"", "start": 16.832, "end": 22.62, "audio_at": 16.772, "dur": 6.027374999999999, "words": [{"text": "Minha", "start": 16.832, "end": 17.087}, {"text": "mãe", "start": 17.099, "end": 17.379}, {"text": "olhou", "start": 17.391, "end": 17.658}, {"text": "pro", "start": 17.67, "end": 17.815}, {"text": "meu", "start": 17.828, "end": 17.997}, {"text": "pulso", "start": 18.01, "end": 18.313}, {"text": "e", "start": 18.325, "end": 18.362}, {"text": "disse", "start": 18.374, "end": 18.738}, {"text": "Guarda", "start": 18.968, "end": 19.393}, {"text": "isso", "start": 19.405, "end": 19.697}, {"text": "filho", "start": 19.988, "end": 20.328}, {"text": "Desculpa", "start": 21.163, "end": 21.746}, {"text": "é", "start": 21.758, "end": 21.819}, {"text": "coisa", "start": 21.831, "end": 22.195}, {"text": "séria", "start": 22.207, "end": 22.62}]}, {"cap": "O pulso dela mostrava três. Ela nunca tinha usado nenhuma.", "start": 23.31, "end": 27.58, "audio_at": 23.25, "dur": 4.510374999999999, "words": [{"text": "O", "start": 23.31, "end": 23.443}, {"text": "pulso", "start": 23.455, "end": 23.819}, {"text": "dela", "start": 23.832, "end": 24.038}, {"text": "mostrava", "start": 24.05, "end": 24.548}, {"text": "três", "start": 24.56, "end": 24.985}, {"text": "Ela", "start": 25.82, "end": 26.087}, {"text": "nunca", "start": 26.1, "end": 26.488}, {"text": "tinha", "start": 26.5, "end": 26.719}, {"text": "usado", "start": 26.731, "end": 27.095}, {"text": "nenhuma", "start": 27.107, "end": 27.58}]}, {"cap": "Com doze, eu quebrei a janela do vizinho jogando bola. O vizinho veio gritando na porta.", "start": 28.27, "end": 34.082, "audio_at": 28.21, "dur": 6.051666999999999, "words": [{"text": "Com", "start": 28.27, "end": 28.476}, {"text": "doze", "start": 28.489, "end": 28.925}, {"text": "eu", "start": 29.168, "end": 29.277}, {"text": "quebrei", "start": 29.29, "end": 29.642}, {"text": "a", "start": 29.654, "end": 29.702}, {"text": "janela", "start": 29.714, "end": 30.103}, {"text": "do", "start": 30.115, "end": 30.2}, {"text": "vizinho", "start": 30.212, "end": 30.612}, {"text": "jogando", "start": 30.625, "end": 31.025}, {"text": "bola", "start": 31.037, "end": 31.401}, {"text": "O", "start": 32.237, "end": 32.346}, {"text": "vizinho", "start": 32.358, "end": 32.832}, {"text": "veio", "start": 32.844, "end": 33.075}, {"text": "gritando", "start": 33.087, "end": 33.524}, {"text": "na", "start": 33.536, "end": 33.657}, {"text": "porta", "start": 33.669, "end": 34.082}]}, {"cap": "Minha mãe foi lá fora conversar. Eu não ouvi o que ela disse. Mas o vizinho foi embora calmo.", "start": 34.772, "end": 41.591, "audio_at": 34.712, "dur": 7.058916999999999, "words": [{"text": "Minha", "start": 34.772, "end": 35.027}, {"text": "mãe", "start": 35.039, "end": 35.318}, {"text": "foi", "start": 35.33, "end": 35.488}, {"text": "lá", "start": 35.5, "end": 35.609}, {"text": "fora", "start": 35.621, "end": 35.937}, {"text": "conversar", "start": 35.949, "end": 36.568}, {"text": "Eu", "start": 37.404, "end": 37.574}, {"text": "não", "start": 37.586, "end": 37.792}, {"text": "ouvi", "start": 37.804, "end": 38.12}, {"text": "o", "start": 38.132, "end": 38.205}, {"text": "que", "start": 38.217, "end": 38.314}, {"text": "ela", "start": 38.326, "end": 38.532}, {"text": "disse", "start": 38.545, "end": 38.957}, {"text": "Mas", "start": 39.795, "end": 40.001}, {"text": "o", "start": 40.013, "end": 40.147}, {"text": "vizinho", "start": 40.159, "end": 40.608}, {"text": "foi", "start": 40.62, "end": 40.765}, {"text": "embora", "start": 40.778, "end": 41.19}, {"text": "calmo", "start": 41.202, "end": 41.591}]}, {"cap": "Com quinze, fui pego colando na prova. Minha mãe foi chamada na escola. Saiu da sala do diretor e só falou: \"Resolvido.\"", "start": 42.281, "end": 51.102, "audio_at": 42.221, "dur": 9.061375, "words": [{"text": "Com", "start": 42.281, "end": 42.499}, {"text": "quinze", "start": 42.511, "end": 42.9}, {"text": "fui", "start": 43.13, "end": 43.324}, {"text": "pego", "start": 43.337, "end": 43.555}, {"text": "colando", "start": 43.567, "end": 43.968}, {"text": "na", "start": 43.98, "end": 44.089}, {"text": "prova", "start": 44.101, "end": 44.477}, {"text": "Minha", "start": 45.313, "end": 45.556}, {"text": "mãe", "start": 45.568, "end": 45.835}, {"text": "foi", "start": 45.847, "end": 46.017}, {"text": "chamada", "start": 46.029, "end": 46.466}, {"text": "na", "start": 46.478, "end": 46.551}, {"text": "escola", "start": 46.563, "end": 47.037}, {"text": "Saiu", "start": 47.874, "end": 48.347}, {"text": "da", "start": 48.359, "end": 48.481}, {"text": "sala", "start": 48.493, "end": 48.808}, {"text": "do", "start": 48.821, "end": 48.93}, {"text": "diretor", "start": 48.942, "end": 49.415}, {"text": "e", "start": 49.427, "end": 49.476}, {"text": "só", "start": 49.488, "end": 49.682}, {"text": "falou", "start": 49.694, "end": 50.095}, {"text": "Resolvido", "start": 50.41, "end": 51.102}]}, {"cap": "Com dezessete, eu bati o carro dela. Ela foi conversar com o outro motorista. Voltou e disse: \"Tá tudo bem.\"", "start": 51.792, "end": 59.861, "audio_at": 51.732, "dur": 8.308917, "words": [{"text": "Com", "start": 51.792, "end": 51.986}, {"text": "dezessete", "start": 51.998, "end": 52.666}, {"text": "eu", "start": 52.848, "end": 52.957}, {"text": "bati", "start": 52.969, "end": 53.273}, {"text": "o", "start": 53.285, "end": 53.345}, {"text": "carro", "start": 53.358, "end": 53.673}, {"text": "dela", "start": 53.685, "end": 54.025}, {"text": "Ela", "start": 54.861, "end": 55.14}, {"text": "foi", "start": 55.152, "end": 55.298}, {"text": "conversar", "start": 55.31, "end": 55.856}, {"text": "com", "start": 55.868, "end": 56.087}, {"text": "o", "start": 56.099, "end": 56.147}, {"text": "outro", "start": 56.16, "end": 56.451}, {"text": "motorista", "start": 56.463, "end": 57.106}, {"text": "Voltou", "start": 57.944, "end": 58.441}, {"text": "e", "start": 58.453, "end": 58.502}, {"text": "disse", "start": 58.514, "end": 58.914}, {"text": "Tá", "start": 59.133, "end": 59.279}, {"text": "tudo", "start": 59.291, "end": 59.57}, {"text": "bem", "start": 59.582, "end": 59.861}]}, {"cap": "Com dezenove, a gente brigou feio. Ela falou uma coisa que doeu muito.", "start": 60.551, "end": 65.38, "audio_at": 60.491, "dur": 5.068624999999999, "words": [{"text": "Com", "start": 60.551, "end": 60.733}, {"text": "dezenove", "start": 60.745, "end": 61.364}, {"text": "a", "start": 61.558, "end": 61.619}, {"text": "gente", "start": 61.631, "end": 61.91}, {"text": "brigou", "start": 61.922, "end": 62.25}, {"text": "feio", "start": 62.262, "end": 62.651}, {"text": "Ela", "start": 63.487, "end": 63.741}, {"text": "falou", "start": 63.753, "end": 64.045}, {"text": "uma", "start": 64.057, "end": 64.239}, {"text": "coisa", "start": 64.251, "end": 64.615}, {"text": "que", "start": 64.627, "end": 64.736}, {"text": "doeu", "start": 64.749, "end": 64.943}, {"text": "muito", "start": 64.955, "end": 65.38}]}, {"cap": "E eu esperei. Esperei ela pedir desculpa. Ela não pediu.", "start": 66.07, "end": 71.068, "audio_at": 66.01, "dur": 5.238541999999999, "words": [{"text": "E", "start": 66.07, "end": 66.203}, {"text": "eu", "start": 66.215, "end": 66.361}, {"text": "esperei", "start": 66.373, "end": 66.883}, {"text": "Esperei", "start": 67.719, "end": 68.192}, {"text": "ela", "start": 68.204, "end": 68.386}, {"text": "pedir", "start": 68.398, "end": 68.69}, {"text": "desculpa", "start": 68.702, "end": 69.296}, {"text": "Ela", "start": 70.134, "end": 70.413}, {"text": "não", "start": 70.425, "end": 70.631}, {"text": "pediu", "start": 70.643, "end": 71.068}]}, {"cap": "Eu fiquei dois anos sem falar com ela.", "start": 71.758, "end": 73.894, "audio_at": 71.698, "dur": 2.3759170000000003, "words": [{"text": "Eu", "start": 71.758, "end": 71.94}, {"text": "fiquei", "start": 71.952, "end": 72.256}, {"text": "dois", "start": 72.268, "end": 72.486}, {"text": "anos", "start": 72.499, "end": 72.887}, {"text": "sem", "start": 72.899, "end": 73.045}, {"text": "falar", "start": 73.057, "end": 73.384}, {"text": "com", "start": 73.397, "end": 73.591}, {"text": "ela", "start": 73.603, "end": 73.894}]}, {"cap": "Todo aniversário, ela mandava mensagem. Eu nunca respondi.", "start": 74.734, "end": 79.187, "audio_at": 74.674, "dur": 4.692457999999999, "words": [{"text": "Todo", "start": 74.734, "end": 75.001}, {"text": "aniversário", "start": 75.013, "end": 75.681}, {"text": "ela", "start": 75.911, "end": 76.093}, {"text": "mandava", "start": 76.106, "end": 76.542}, {"text": "mensagem", "start": 76.555, "end": 77.186}, {"text": "Eu", "start": 78.022, "end": 78.204}, {"text": "nunca", "start": 78.216, "end": 78.592}, {"text": "respondi", "start": 78.604, "end": 79.187}]}, {"cap": "E todo dia, ela deixava a luz da varanda acesa… caso eu voltasse.", "start": 79.877, "end": 83.918, "audio_at": 79.817, "dur": 4.281292, "words": [{"text": "E", "start": 79.877, "end": 79.998}, {"text": "todo", "start": 80.01, "end": 80.277}, {"text": "dia", "start": 80.289, "end": 80.593}, {"text": "ela", "start": 80.787, "end": 80.969}, {"text": "deixava", "start": 80.981, "end": 81.381}, {"text": "a", "start": 81.394, "end": 81.418}, {"text": "luz", "start": 81.43, "end": 81.685}, {"text": "da", "start": 81.697, "end": 81.806}, {"text": "varanda", "start": 81.818, "end": 82.182}, {"text": "acesa", "start": 82.195, "end": 82.619}, {"text": "caso", "start": 82.85, "end": 83.202}, {"text": "eu", "start": 83.214, "end": 83.275}, {"text": "voltasse", "start": 83.287, "end": 83.918}]}, {"cap": "Até o dia em que eu voltei. A luz ainda tava acesa.", "start": 84.858, "end": 88.643, "audio_at": 84.798, "dur": 4.024958, "words": [{"text": "Até", "start": 84.858, "end": 85.246}, {"text": "o", "start": 85.258, "end": 85.343}, {"text": "dia", "start": 85.355, "end": 85.598}, {"text": "em", "start": 85.61, "end": 85.695}, {"text": "que", "start": 85.707, "end": 85.792}, {"text": "eu", "start": 85.804, "end": 85.889}, {"text": "voltei", "start": 85.902, "end": 86.363}, {"text": "A", "start": 87.199, "end": 87.308}, {"text": "luz", "start": 87.32, "end": 87.538}, {"text": "ainda", "start": 87.551, "end": 87.927}, {"text": "tava", "start": 87.939, "end": 88.157}, {"text": "acesa", "start": 88.17, "end": 88.643}]}, {"cap": "Ela abriu a porta… e eu vi o pulso dela de perto.", "start": 89.383, "end": 92.283, "audio_at": 89.323, "dur": 3.1405000000000003, "words": [{"text": "Ela", "start": 89.383, "end": 89.577}, {"text": "abriu", "start": 89.589, "end": 89.88}, {"text": "a", "start": 89.893, "end": 89.965}, {"text": "porta", "start": 89.978, "end": 90.439}, {"text": "e", "start": 90.621, "end": 90.694}, {"text": "eu", "start": 90.706, "end": 90.851}, {"text": "vi", "start": 90.863, "end": 90.997}, {"text": "o", "start": 91.009, "end": 91.082}, {"text": "pulso", "start": 91.094, "end": 91.458}, {"text": "dela", "start": 91.47, "end": 91.737}, {"text": "de", "start": 91.749, "end": 91.871}, {"text": "perto", "start": 91.883, "end": 92.283}]}, {"cap": "Zero.", "start": 93.223, "end": 93.672, "audio_at": 93.163, "dur": 0.689041, "words": [{"text": "Zero", "start": 93.223, "end": 93.672}]}, {"cap": "A janela. A prova. O carro.", "start": 94.912, "end": 98.467, "audio_at": 94.852, "dur": 3.794375, "words": [{"text": "A", "start": 94.912, "end": 95.034}, {"text": "janela", "start": 95.046, "end": 95.592}, {"text": "A", "start": 96.428, "end": 96.561}, {"text": "prova", "start": 96.574, "end": 97.01}, {"text": "O", "start": 97.848, "end": 97.993}, {"text": "carro", "start": 98.006, "end": 98.467}]}, {"cap": "Ela gastou as três dela pedindo desculpa por mim.", "start": 99.157, "end": 101.875, "audio_at": 99.097, "dur": 2.9584590000000004, "words": [{"text": "Ela", "start": 99.157, "end": 99.399}, {"text": "gastou", "start": 99.412, "end": 99.8}, {"text": "as", "start": 99.812, "end": 99.982}, {"text": "três", "start": 99.994, "end": 100.273}, {"text": "dela", "start": 100.285, "end": 100.516}, {"text": "pedindo", "start": 100.528, "end": 100.904}, {"text": "desculpa", "start": 100.916, "end": 101.426}, {"text": "por", "start": 101.438, "end": 101.608}, {"text": "mim", "start": 101.62, "end": 101.875}]}, {"cap": "Não sobrou nenhuma pra ela.", "start": 102.565, "end": 104.191, "audio_at": 102.505, "dur": 1.86625, "words": [{"text": "Não", "start": 102.565, "end": 102.82}, {"text": "sobrou", "start": 102.832, "end": 103.208}, {"text": "nenhuma", "start": 103.221, "end": 103.645}, {"text": "pra", "start": 103.657, "end": 103.827}, {"text": "ela", "start": 103.84, "end": 104.191}]}, {"cap": "Eu olhei pro meu pulso. Ainda tinha duas.", "start": 104.881, "end": 108.169, "audio_at": 104.821, "dur": 3.527375, "words": [{"text": "Eu", "start": 104.881, "end": 105.088}, {"text": "olhei", "start": 105.1, "end": 105.367}, {"text": "pro", "start": 105.379, "end": 105.525}, {"text": "meu", "start": 105.537, "end": 105.731}, {"text": "pulso", "start": 105.743, "end": 106.144}, {"text": "Ainda", "start": 106.98, "end": 107.344}, {"text": "tinha", "start": 107.356, "end": 107.671}, {"text": "duas", "start": 107.683, "end": 108.169}]}, {"cap": "Usei uma ali mesmo: \"Desculpa, mãe.\"", "start": 108.859, "end": 111.31, "audio_at": 108.799, "dur": 2.691459, "words": [{"text": "Usei", "start": 108.859, "end": 109.259}, {"text": "uma", "start": 109.271, "end": 109.393}, {"text": "ali", "start": 109.405, "end": 109.575}, {"text": "mesmo", "start": 109.587, "end": 109.975}, {"text": "Desculpa", "start": 110.206, "end": 110.801}, {"text": "mãe", "start": 111.019, "end": 111.31}]}, {"cap": "E ela, sem número nenhum, só me abraçou.", "start": 112.0, "end": 114.755, "audio_at": 111.94, "dur": 2.9948340000000004, "words": [{"text": "E", "start": 112.0, "end": 112.134}, {"text": "ela", "start": 112.146, "end": 112.437}, {"text": "sem", "start": 112.668, "end": 112.886}, {"text": "número", "start": 112.898, "end": 113.202}, {"text": "nenhum", "start": 113.214, "end": 113.578}, {"text": "só", "start": 113.857, "end": 114.063}, {"text": "me", "start": 114.076, "end": 114.185}, {"text": "abraçou", "start": 114.197, "end": 114.755}]}, {"cap": "Ela chorou e disse: \"Eu queria tanto te pedir desculpa… mas não tinha mais nenhuma.\"", "start": 115.895, "end": 120.434, "audio_at": 115.835, "dur": 4.778833, "words": [{"text": "Ela", "start": 115.895, "end": 116.138}, {"text": "chorou", "start": 116.15, "end": 116.466}, {"text": "e", "start": 116.478, "end": 116.526}, {"text": "disse", "start": 116.538, "end": 116.939}, {"text": "Eu", "start": 117.084, "end": 117.182}, {"text": "queria", "start": 117.194, "end": 117.521}, {"text": "tanto", "start": 117.533, "end": 117.898}, {"text": "te", "start": 117.91, "end": 117.995}, {"text": "pedir", "start": 118.007, "end": 118.274}, {"text": "desculpa", "start": 118.286, "end": 118.796}, {"text": "mas", "start": 119.123, "end": 119.317}, {"text": "não", "start": 119.33, "end": 119.475}, {"text": "tinha", "start": 119.487, "end": 119.73}, {"text": "mais", "start": 119.742, "end": 119.973}, {"text": "nenhuma", "start": 119.985, "end": 120.434}]}, {"cap": "Hoje, o meu pulso mostra um.", "start": 121.274, "end": 123.179, "audio_at": 121.214, "dur": 2.1453330000000004, "words": [{"text": "Hoje", "start": 121.274, "end": 121.687}, {"text": "o", "start": 121.905, "end": 121.966}, {"text": "meu", "start": 121.978, "end": 122.172}, {"text": "pulso", "start": 122.184, "end": 122.488}, {"text": "mostra", "start": 122.5, "end": 122.924}, {"text": "um", "start": 122.937, "end": 123.179}]}, {"cap": "E eu tô guardando. Porque um dia, alguém que eu amo vai precisar que eu peça desculpa por ele.", "start": 123.919, "end": 129.658, "audio_at": 123.859, "dur": 5.978833999999999, "words": [{"text": "E", "start": 123.919, "end": 124.029}, {"text": "eu", "start": 124.041, "end": 124.174}, {"text": "tô", "start": 124.186, "end": 124.332}, {"text": "guardando", "start": 124.344, "end": 124.927}, {"text": "Porque", "start": 125.763, "end": 126.054}, {"text": "um", "start": 126.066, "end": 126.199}, {"text": "dia", "start": 126.212, "end": 126.527}, {"text": "alguém", "start": 126.709, "end": 127.013}, {"text": "que", "start": 127.025, "end": 127.097}, {"text": "eu", "start": 127.11, "end": 127.255}, {"text": "amo", "start": 127.267, "end": 127.462}, {"text": "vai", "start": 127.474, "end": 127.607}, {"text": "precisar", "start": 127.619, "end": 128.129}, {"text": "que", "start": 128.141, "end": 128.226}, {"text": "eu", "start": 128.238, "end": 128.335}, {"text": "peça", "start": 128.347, "end": 128.675}, {"text": "desculpa", "start": 128.687, "end": 129.185}, {"text": "por", "start": 129.197, "end": 129.355}, {"text": "ele", "start": 129.367, "end": 129.658}]}, {"cap": "Se você pudesse usar uma desculpa agora… pra quem seria? Comenta.", "start": 130.798, "end": 135.433, "audio_at": 130.738, "dur": 4.874499999999999, "words": [{"text": "Se", "start": 130.798, "end": 131.004}, {"text": "você", "start": 131.017, "end": 131.296}, {"text": "pudesse", "start": 131.308, "end": 131.72}, {"text": "usar", "start": 131.733, "end": 132.0}, {"text": "uma", "start": 132.012, "end": 132.145}, {"text": "desculpa", "start": 132.157, "end": 132.582}, {"text": "agora", "start": 132.594, "end": 132.958}, {"text": "pra", "start": 133.177, "end": 133.347}, {"text": "quem", "start": 133.359, "end": 133.541}, {"text": "seria", "start": 133.553, "end": 134.014}, {"text": "Comenta", "start": 134.85, "end": 135.433}]}]}